<main class="service-detail-page"><div class="container"><div class="row service-detail-layout"><aside class="col-lg-4"><div class="service-sidebar"><div class="service-nav-card"><h3>Freight Services</h3><ul>
<li><a href="ocean-freight.html">Ocean Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="air-freight.html">Air Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a class="active" href="cargo-freight.html">Cargo Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="express-delivery.html">Express Delivery <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="customs-clearance.html">Customs Clearance <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="project-cargo.html">Project Cargo <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="pet-transport.html">Pet Transport <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li>
</ul></div><div class="service-help-card"><h3>Need help choosing transport?</h3><p>We’ll review your load, route, deadline, and handling needs together.</p><a href="contact.html">Speak to Our Freight Team <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-2"></i></a></div></div></aside>
<div class="col-lg-8"><div class="service-main-image"><img src="/images/service-3.jpg" alt="Commercial cargo prepared for coordinated freight transportation"></div>
<section class="service-overview"><div class="service-kicker">Transport that fits your cargo</div><h1>A freight plan that fits your shipment</h1><p>Cargo size, weight, destination, and timing all shape the transport plan. We coordinate freight for pallets, commercial goods, equipment, and general cargo around those requirements.</p><p><%= business.name %> connects transport stages and delivery partners, giving you one point of coordination from pickup to the final handoff.</p></section>
<section class="service-features"><h2 class="service-section-title">Ways we support your cargo</h2><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-pallet"></i><h3>Palletized freight</h3><p>Transport planning for packaged goods and palletized commercial loads.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-truck"></i><h3>Road coordination</h3><p>Collection, transfers, and delivery for regional and long-distance shipments.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-shuffle"></i><h3>Multimodal planning</h3><p>Road, air, and ocean connections planned around your cargo’s priorities.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-check"></i><h3>Shipment visibility</h3><p>Shipment references and updates at key points along the route.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="service-process"><h2 class="service-section-title">From cargo details to delivery</h2><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">01</div><h3>Define</h3><p>We review the cargo, route, access, and required dates.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">02</div><h3>Match</h3><p>We match the load with suitable transport and handling.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">03</div><h3>Dispatch</h3><p>Your cargo is collected and dispatched along the planned route.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">04</div><h3>Handoff</h3><p>We arrange the handoff with the receiving team.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="service-faqs"><h2 class="service-section-title">Questions about cargo freight</h2><div class="accordion" id="cargoFaq"><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#cargoOne">Which goods can this service handle?</button></h3><div id="cargoOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#cargoFaq"><div class="accordion-body">We coordinate many types of commercial goods, pallets, packaged products, and equipment. Tell us exactly what you’re shipping so we can check suitability and restrictions.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#cargoTwo">How do I get my freight ready?</button></h3><div id="cargoTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#cargoFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Choose packaging suited to the goods, their weight, and the planned handling. Accurate measurements and weights help us arrange appropriate equipment.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#cargoThree">Can a shipment combine road, air, and sea?</button></h3><div id="cargoThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#cargoFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Yes. We can connect different transport modes when that approach suits the route, schedule, and delivery needs.</div></div></div></div></section>
<div class="service-cta"><div><h2>Plan your next cargo shipment</h2><p>Tell us about your cargo and we’ll help you plan its journey.</p></div><a href="/quote?service=cargo_freight" class="btn-default">Request a Quote</a></div></div></div></div></main><%- include('../partials/site-footer') %><script src="/js/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script><script src="/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script><script src="/js/jquery.slicknav.js"></script><script src="/js/service-navigation.js"></script></body></html>
